  "notable_quotes": [
    "The resulting materials exhibit inverse ethane/ethylene separation along with good CO2/CH4 separation performance.",
    "Tetrazolate-pillared CPM-63 materials are highly porous and show adsorption for N2, CO2, CH4, C2H2, C2H4, and C2H6, aided by open N-donor sites.",
    "Before this work, no kag lattice based on bent ligands had been reported, even though kgm layers were known for paddlewheel units with bent dicarboxylates."
